# Bench results are machine- and load-specific measurements, not source.
# The files that used to live here were produced by the sleep-based suites
# (see bench/run_all.py) and measured asyncio.sleep resolution rather than
# Eden, so they were deleted rather than kept as a baseline.
#
# Generate locally with `python -m bench.run_all`, and gate with
# `python -m bench.compare <baseline.json> <candidate.json>`.
*.json
!baseline.json
!f12-span-search-*.json
